  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "781f12f17f422ba1",
      "translationZh": "为持久运行的智能体世界设计 Grok Bot | SpaceXAI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "afa877360e964d12",
      "translationZh": "为持久运行的智能体世界设计 Grok Bot",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f5917813e6a94a8",
      "translationZh": "我们如何为超越单次会话、持续运行的智能体设计 Grok Bot——从聊天历史到 Bot 名册、在线状态、Bot 自己的电脑，以及无需提示即可开始的工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a6e90ef27eea7d6",
      "translationZh": "刚开始设计 Grok Bot 时，一个核心问题是：界面应该如何塑造用户与智能体之间的关系。大多数 AI 界面都围绕由用户操作的聊天会话来组织。每次会话都从设置开始，在用户的注视下展开，并随着对话停止而结束。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29c91da980042299",
      "translationZh": "我们希望设计的是一个能够超越任何单次会话、持续运行，并能独立承担责任的智能体。这意味着重新思考界面中的一些基本对象和信号，包括侧边栏里应该放什么、智能体如何展示进展，以及它的工作何时应该呈现给用户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96a5ef27e8ac5c71",
      "translationZh": "周五全员大会的演示文稿，需要你点头确认。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cdbace0de7e4524",
      "translationZh": "8 封引荐邮件已拟好——放在 CRM 里，等你发送。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "743f2ab91d2b9efb",
      "translationZh": "收件箱里还有 3 封邮件。其中两封今天需要回复。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b4c978a9cde2b9c",
      "translationZh": "John：结账功能在预发布环境中没问题，3 个 bug 已关闭。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41f7295343d8a136",
      "translationZh": "复现了结账时的崩溃。详细说明在工单里。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52075c3446dfb10b",
      "translationZh": "Acme 的情况不太稳。已起草周四跟进沟通的内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a83976dfe3a82b0f",
      "translationZh": "已收到 14 张收据。还缺你周二的 Uber 收据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cddc4ffbe3744781",
      "translationZh": "发布公告帖已上线。已有首批 200 次展示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f56b75880af8c16b",
      "translationZh": "SoMa 有 3 套房。Folsom 那套两居室就是我们要找的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e4d0e8617ad191c",
      "translationZh": "找到了 3 位候选人。跳过了一个已在你 ATS 里的候选人。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d22681f83b7aa14",
      "translationZh": "嘿，今天的设计同步会主要有哪些要点？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e18a4c6f09341d6",
      "translationZh": "团队在这次会议中花了大部分时间评审新的用户引导流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3962f887e36acde6",
      "translationZh": "讨论最多的是空状态。Sarah 觉得目前的插画不符合新的品牌方向，在场的大多数人也表示赞同。大家还就进度指示器应该放在页眉还是侧边栏进行了长时间的来回讨论。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1de15d737f8afdbc",
      "translationZh": "不过，整体氛围是积极的。大多数人认为，这个流程已接近可以开展更大范围评审的阶段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f0c13bdd10d5175",
      "translationZh": "有人提到 Q3 路线图了吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4076d0e1ebba59fd",
      "translationZh": "有，提到了两次。Marcus 说，路线图评审目前预计在八月第一周进行，Priya 则问用户引导相关工作会在那之前还是之后落地。会议上没有确定任何具体日期。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8f4502300e39a910",
      "translationZh": "重新思考基本构件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "235fb6a0adb9095a",
      "translationZh": "AI 产品在短时间内积累了大量术语。聊天、会话、模型、上下文窗口、记忆、系统提示词、项目、技能、连接器、智能体、工具、沙箱、权限和自动化，都描述了这些系统中真实存在的组成部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb9c8ed1cf09582b",
      "translationZh": "但将每一个都呈现为独立的产品概念，会要求用户理解超出其实际所需的内容。我们首先问的是：一个人要与智能体协作，究竟需要理解哪些概念？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f379f4bf00f321fd",
      "translationZh": "我们反复思考，最终总是回到这五个概念：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "adc77f55ea9213ee",
      "translationZh": "Bot 是持久存在的智能体，拥有自己的身份、记忆、运行环境和工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c53953291300ad42",
      "translationZh": "聊天是与 Bot 协作的对话界面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4afd315afc2fd281",
      "translationZh": "提示词为 Bot 提供上下文或指令。它们可以一次性使用、保存为技能，也可以作为例行任务自动触发。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e741f9b5b37699d9",
      "translationZh": "工具让 Bot 能够通过软件、API、连接器、shell 或计算机操作来访问信息并采取行动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8486c58bf56974fa",
      "translationZh": "产出物是 Bot 创建或修改的文档、设计、代码、数据及其他可持久保存的输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09621383656e3c3d",
      "translationZh": "其他一切都可以继续隐藏在界面之下，直到用户有理由关注它们。接下来的问题是，应该以这五种对象中的哪一种来组织产品。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f0985b0e170d6883",
      "translationZh": "从聊天历史到 Bot 名册",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "201831b0c6f90410",
      "translationZh": "聊天是用完即弃的。我们发起一段对话来解决一个问题。随后，它就被挤到侧边栏的下方。一周后，我们又发起另一段对话。你很少会回看最近五段以外的对话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bebd879d8161623",
      "translationZh": "当交互的单位是一个问题时，这种行为完全合理。但当交互另一端的那个存在本应了解你、记住之前的工作，并持续承担责任时，这种行为就显得奇怪了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77b1853b7717f3b6",
      "translationZh": "因此，Grok Bot 中的主要对象是 Bot，而不是对话。一个 Bot 有自己的名字，有头像和头衔。它会记住与你的对话。它有自己的电脑和工具。当你明天回来时，你面对的还是同一个 Bot。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76b199be72733c75",
      "translationZh": "起草一封周五通话后发给 Acme 的跟进邮件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4899fa59a9c97afa",
      "translationZh": "重写定价单页介绍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c1cea990d98645e",
      "translationZh": "在安全审查中，我应该问些什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32e9be5bdc11c906",
      "translationZh": "根据我的通话笔记，绘制一张客户内部支持者关系图",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "793ae42b18824acd",
      "translationZh": "练习演示，应对棘手的异议",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9fa3ade404b1f4a",
      "translationZh": "帮我比较这三份竞争对手的演示文稿",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "80dd6183600ec59a",
      "translationZh": "以存在感作为界面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cffc728d49d4b55d",
      "translationZh": "一旦 Bot 成为你需要持续维护的事物，而不再是你开启的一次会话，Bot 在产品中的呈现方式就必须同时回答三个问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "67227326c337dfd6",
      "translationZh": "我需要了解多少信息？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e06cf9ae69077ef9",
      "translationZh": "只有能够快速扫视，名册才有用。随着名册不断扩大，我们不希望用户每次打开产品时都必须逐一阅读所有名称。他们应该几乎只凭余光，就能从头像认出一个 Bot。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4efb8b4974fb43c",
      "translationZh": "Bot 头像视觉风格探索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3ce405f4839cf82",
      "translationZh": "与此同时，我们希望头像保持足够的一致性，让人一看就知道它们属于同一套系统。我们研究了插画、动画、游戏和界面设计中的角色体系，探索了从首字母和表情符号，到像素艺术、水彩、黏土拟态、Noritake 风格线描、剪影以及标识图案等各种方向。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba8a924c8b356cf6",
      "translationZh": "大多数方案都更擅长解决问题的某一面，而非另一面。水彩和黏土风格赋予了各个 Bot 鲜明的个性，但在侧边栏的显示尺寸下，细节过多。更简洁的体系能更自然地融入界面，却往往让各个 Bot 看起来没什么区别。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d483fde33830ea15",
      "translationZh": "我们最终确定的系统保持了基本构造的一致性，采用简单的形状和富有表现力的眼睛，再通过有节制的变化和配饰体现差异。每个 Bot 都能让人一眼认出，同时又不会显得来自不同的视觉世界。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edb6faf0ccbd12b2",
      "translationZh": "一旦头像成为 Bot 的身份标识，它也就自然成了展示状态的地方。Bot 可能处于空闲、思考、工作、等待、受阻或完成状态。我们本可以用单独的指示器表示每种状态，但这会增加一层需要用户解读的 UI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4be2b48d8fa48515",
      "translationZh": "因此，我们转而探索头像本身能承载多少生命周期信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd58b83a3af6f826",
      "translationZh": "静止时，Bot 显得平静，略带好奇。任务到来时，它会确认收到任务。工作开始时，它就进入运转状态。等待或需要帮助时，它的动作会再次变化，工作完成后则恢复平静。现在，头像既能展示 Bot 正在做什么，也能表明它是哪一个 Bot。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5734ee4591fdce9",
      "translationZh": "另一个相关的设计问题是，要展示多少 Bot 的执行过程。一种做法是采用常见的“三个动态圆点”，但这样提供的信息太少，用户很难判断 Bot 是正在工作，还是卡住了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6102ab0f615c3dd6",
      "translationZh": "环境已就绪 387ms",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0f6a5b89ef1ed129",
      "translationZh": "已编辑 math.ts + 14 − 10",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1461da56d7cc50d6",
      "translationZh": "已运行针对性测试 npm test",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d4bd086d75c455ac",
      "translationZh": "运行了类型检查 npm run",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cf37abd44fd146b9",
      "translationZh": "在代码中搜索了“toFixed”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "07ee32046a97ce36",
      "translationZh": "编辑了 math.test.ts + 6 − 2",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f28d69b3515df8dd",
      "translationZh": "运行了完整测试套件，212 项通过",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "68ef868aed53c611",
      "translationZh": "提交了修复：钳制 NaN",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64fa9e20bf14196a",
      "translationZh": "我们也尝试过用简短的文字描述 Bot 当前的操作，但当人们能看到一个步骤后，就想看到其余步骤。用户研究表明，他们要求这些细节，主要是为了确认 Bot 仍在工作，并且方向正确，从而感到安心。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8ab76dcb4cd1f3e",
      "translationZh": "在最终设计中，头像的动态会表明 Bot 处于活跃状态，首先让用户感到安心。如果有人想查看它正在做什么，可以将鼠标悬停在头像上，查看它当前的操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bf2d734c71853137",
      "translationZh": "他们的电脑，不是你的",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db20d1cb09573ee1",
      "translationZh": "每个 Bot 都有自己的计算机，可以用它浏览网页、处理文件和运行软件。这又带来了一个界面问题：这台计算机应该有多显眼，用户又应该在什么时候能够控制它？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56d01c12331dc1d2",
      "translationZh": "我们探索了四种布局方式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b9f5c96e1f5f94a",
      "translationZh": "浮动窗口：让用户可以轻松访问计算机，但会遮挡对话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "73ca0b9238aa2907",
      "translationZh": "并排显示：让工作过程始终可见，并鼓励用户观看。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e9bdde5e84f19aac",
      "translationZh": "模态窗口：便于用户随时查看，但把 Bot 的工作空间变成了对当前活动的临时打断。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "05ca2d4be45ebbef",
      "translationZh": "全屏显示：给计算机提供了充足的空间，但完全挤走了对话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2f3708d9bf89291",
      "translationZh": "我们把计算机做得越显眼，产品就越是在鼓励用户监督它。我们决定，它应该仍然是 Bot 的工作空间，由界面根据用户的需要提供不同层级的访问方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46b0583a95455d9f",
      "translationZh": "最终设计有三个层级，让用户能够进入 Bot 的工作空间，而不至于被引导着亲自操作它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "516277b8fe62641e",
      "translationZh": "状态：电脑处于活动状态时，标题栏图标会变成紫色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "57f24de49ce19f1c",
      "translationZh": "预览：打开后会显示一个固定的侧边面板，用户无需离开对话即可查看工作进展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0b124c7e872aee9",
      "translationZh": "接管：当 Bot 需要帮助时，用户可以全屏打开电脑，接管控制权，然后再交还给它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eaef41053f2bcf83",
      "translationZh": "我们还设计了随一天中的时间变化而变化的壁纸，早晨变亮，夜晚变暗。这个细节赋予了 Bot 的电脑独有的时间感，让它感觉与用户的桌面相互独立。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf74ae7b7f3db235",
      "translationZh": "这更像是与同事一起工作，而不是操作一台远程机器。你能看出它正在工作，需要了解上下文时可以瞥一眼它的屏幕，遇到需要你帮忙的事情时也可以坐下来接手。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "33541991b7446b86",
      "translationZh": "信息的形态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de25a1e3e0b6150e",
      "translationZh": "早期版本的 Grok Bot 几乎对所有请求都用文字作答。它会描述五天的天气预报，而不是直接展示预报；会叙述一组任务，而不是把任务排列成看板。用户随后还得重新组织答案。这促使我们将回复的形式视为答案的一部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7eeed33f39a0e43",
      "translationZh": "为此，我们在 Grok Bot 中加入了内嵌卡片和小组件。当文字适合呈现信息时，Bot 可以用文字回答；不适合时，则可以使用结构化 UI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1736421a028cba00",
      "translationZh": "主题：将周五的设计评审改到下午 2 点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c314a09386bcf8d",
      "translationZh": "我们能把周五的设计评审从上午 11 点改到下午 2 点吗？临时有个客户电话，我不想让我们的讨论太仓促。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14016c04c0b1fb0a",
      "translationZh": "同样的原则也适用于操作。当一个 Bot 创建 Routine、更改设置或向另一个 Bot 发送消息时，该事件可以直接显示在对话记录中。如果有更多内容需要查看，用户可以展开它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e4756119332dd28",
      "translationZh": "早上好！能帮我问问大家的进展吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a7160a52d8cef4c",
      "translationZh": "马上办——现在就联系团队了解进展",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49d1571ff244544c",
      "translationZh": "与 Kenny、Tyler 和 Jenny 的 6 条消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "686ab008a9edbfc7",
      "translationZh": "一切按计划推进：Kenny 已上线着陆页，Tyler 已发送本月的发票，Jenny 已安排好下周的面试。没有阻碍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18fef96eabff78aa",
      "translationZh": "太好了，你能每天早上都这样做吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "199db2258da7f30e",
      "translationZh": "已创建例行任务：晨间简报",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05c40988b98de084",
      "translationZh": "完成，你的晨间简报将于每天 9:00 出现在这里",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cb72556f34b292a",
      "translationZh": "最终形成的是一份异构记录，对话、系统事件、交互对象和可视化内容共同呈现在一条时间线上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "46a02954c5d5d8bc",
      "translationZh": "组织智能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "828b4bd6e76eb638",
      "translationZh": "一旦人们创建了多个 Bot，产品也必须组织这些 Bot 如何协同工作。我们需要决定哪些上下文应归属于各个角色，Bot 在工作重叠时应如何共享上下文，以及如何协调它们，而不让用户变成调度员。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c45a3c7fd206c723",
      "translationZh": "随着人们创建更多 Bot，我们看到一种解决方案逐渐浮现。有些人创建了一个幕僚长 Bot，负责协调多个专家 Bot。这样，他们就可以向一个 Bot 下达指示，而不必逐一检查每个 Bot，并亲自分派每项任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d773e93c6765ee24",
      "translationZh": "赋予 Bot 不同的角色，也迫使我们决定每个角色应该知道什么。法律 Bot 可能需要了解某起正在进行的纠纷的来龙去脉，而财务 Bot 可能需要多年的财务记录。将这些历史信息合并成一份庞大的记忆，会让我们更难为每个 Bot 提供与其工作相关的信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68b3d68f99b8a18c",
      "translationZh": "因此，在 Grok Bot 中，能力与上下文遵循不同的边界。工具和技能位于账户层级，因为许多 Bot 都可能需要浏览网页、处理文档或发送电子邮件。记忆和例行任务则归属于 Bot，因为它们反映了该特定角色随着时间推移所掌握的信息和执行的工作。换句话说，能力可以广泛共享，而上下文则保留在需要它的角色中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5b811a0e9e889a9",
      "translationZh": "有些工作会跨越这些角色边界。群聊为项目或团队提供共享上下文，同时让每个 Bot 保留其专业领域的记忆。设计师、工程师、产品经理和数据科学家可以在同一个对话中工作，将工作交接给彼此，并分享项目所需的信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b56acd2876718fc",
      "translationZh": "我们曾考虑添加仪表盘、任务分配看板和明确的交接控件来管理这些群组。但每增加一项，都会给用户带来更多协调工作。因此，我们转而让负责协调的 Bot 处理常规的任务分派，并在某个决策需要判断时让用户参与进来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eac655ec346fe772",
      "translationZh": "持续推进的工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eea9911660650f50",
      "translationZh": "大多数智能体会话始于用户发送提示词。这意味着，即使是持久运行的 Bot，也仍在等待有人来激活它。Routines 让用户可以赋予 Bot 一项长期职责，按计划或在事件发生时执行，例如持续关注某个行业，或每天早晨准备一份简报。用户只需定义一次工作，Routine 就会在需要执行时激活 Bot。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f98f7263da5bf8a4",
      "translationZh": "最初，我们将 Routines 视为次要的配置项。随着它们对自主工作的意义越来越大，我们将它们移到了 Bot 的主界面中。对话记录会显示已执行的工作，也为用户提供一个查看结果或处理异常的地方。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1780220bd6de469",
      "translationZh": "每月 1 日上午 8:00",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e169fb60809c84fd",
      "translationZh": "在 grokbot 中创建 Issue",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
